Z||000000||Hock||04-29-2000||04:33 AM||||I'm back!!!!!!!!!!!! I bet some of you forgotten me. Well here I am again. This time I'm in Okinawa, Japan. Why? Because I'm in the Marine Corps and this is where I wanted to go. <P>Ok, here's the problem. I'm gonna be returning to the states in about 11 months and I need another car. My 85' Fiero was a science experiment gone bad. But thats what I get for trying to work against stock electronics. Anyways I now own a 79 Mustang Cobra which is currently in the process of getting redone for a weekend toy. Now after being over here for a month I want to get another Fiero to drive when I get back. Does anybody got any suggestions? This vehicle will also be driven by my future wife so I'm not to sure about what to get. I'd hate to get an automatic but thats the way I'm looking at this time. Can anybody help me on this one?||||reg||5
Z||000001||fieroshop||04-29-2000||09:58 AM||||In leven months you will most likely either stop in L. A or the S.F. bay area. In either case I will most likely have a Fiero. E-mail me off list since I do have several Fieros waiting to be restored at this time. I do like ED Parks, we both wait until we have a deposit and then go to town and restore a Fiero. That also means paint and I can custom pait at that time.||||reg||1
